iationPostprocess (the wrapper reads the per-gene regional\n# + per-variant pairs, assembles a per-gene QtlSumStats, and writes the enriched\n# consolidated RDS + per-method regional / significant-QTL / event / summary\n# tables). Replaces the old source(pecotmr/inst/code/tensorqtl_postprocessor.R).\noutput: f\"{output_dir:a}/{cwd:b}.qtl_association_postprocessing.rds\"\nbash: expand = \"${ }\"\n    Rscript ${modular_script_dir:a}/pecotmr_integration/qtl_association_postprocessing.R \\\n        --cwd ${work_dir:a} \\\n        --regional-pattern \"${regional_pattern}\" \\\n        --qtl-pattern \"${qtl_pattern}\" \\\n        --n-variants-suffix \"${n_variants_suffix}\" \\\n        --maf-cutoff ${maf_cutoff} --cis-window ${cis_window} \\\n        --fdr-threshold ${fdr_threshold} --pvalue-cutoff ${pvalue_cutoff} \\\n        --pvalue-col \"${pvalue_col}\" --af-col \"${af_col}\" \\\n        --study \"${study}\" --context \"${context}\" --genome \"${genome}\" \\\n        --output ${_output:a} --output-dir ${output_dir:a}\n","key":"DJZEabqpQ6"},{"type":"outputs","id":"kTixai0ZWtZkOgj-dUzGt","children":[],"key":"NBw0F9RnPE"}],"identifier":"dcb0e78c","html_id":"dcb0e78c","key":"BqkqnyNI1t"}],"key":"LCICpHJ1Go"},"references":{"cite":{"order":["Huang2018Power"],"data":{"Huang2018Power":{"label":"Huang2018Power","enumerator":"1","doi":"10.1093/nar/gky780","html":"Huang, Q. Q., Ritchie, S. C., Brozynska, M., & Inouye, M. (2018). Power, false discovery rate and Winner’s Curse in eQTL studies. <i>Nucleic Acids Research</i>, <i>46</i>(22), e133–e133. <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1093/nar/gky780\">10.1093/nar/gky780</a>","url":"https://doi.org/10.1093/nar/gky780"}}}},"footer":{"navigation":{"prev":{"title":"Quantile regression for QTL association testing","url":"/qr-and-twas","group":"QTL Association Testing"},"next":{"title":"Multivariate adaptive shrinkage (MASH) mini-protocol","url":"/mash","group":"Multivariate Mixture Models"}}},"domain":"ht